=== Adaptive Smart Traffic Signal Controller (software skeleton) ===
Using MOCK GPIO layer - safe to run with no hardware attached.

[gpio_mock] Initialized (console simulation mode)
[gpio_mock] Type 'e0' + Enter to simulate an emergency vehicle on NS approach, 'e1' for EW approach.

